    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0Fast-Fast Food is a cooking simulator where you become the owner of a food truck! Cheese stuck to the floor, a flat tire, a burnt cutlet, a human-burger, hooligans \u2014 and this is only a small part of your new everyday life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714260/extras/9d59fa4dd8f2036ee8eb3d55156b7de7.poster.avif?t=1755158985\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714260/extras/9d59fa4dd8f2036ee8eb3d55156b7de7.webm?t=1755158985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714260/extras/9d59fa4dd8f2036ee8eb3d55156b7de7.mp4?t=1755158985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0Become a chef, cook the best dishes, serve customers and earn your first million gold coins! Adventures, funny characters, different types of customers, Mr. Raccoon and birds, fires and ill-wishers, all this and much more awaits you in Fast-Fast Food!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714260/extras/31f572fb30364e617a25c095bfed775a.poster.avif?t=1755158985\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714260/extras/31f572fb30364e617a25c095bfed775a.webm?t=1755158985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714260/extras/31f572fb30364e617a25c095bfed775a.mp4?t=1755158985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0Go on an adventure! Traveling through picturesque cities and cozy villages, you\u2019ll find items for upgrading the kitchen, as well as new recipes. Complete tasks of the locals, find unique characters and make your brand the most recognizable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714260/extras/e34ee708eb6c0884ba0989860b2f6bd2.poster.avif?t=1755158985\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714260/extras/e34ee708eb6c0884ba0989860b2f6bd2.webm?t=1755158985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714260/extras/e34ee708eb6c0884ba0989860b2f6bd2.mp4?t=1755158985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0Improve your kitchen, buy new ingredients and automate production. Earn more, become recognizable and create the best food truck. Upgrade your mobile kitchen track and win the Street Food Festival!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714260/extras/03ecaa29e2d9d2f140fe45b23c467f49.poster.avif?t=1755158985\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714260/extras/03ecaa29e2d9d2f140fe45b23c467f49.webm?t=1755158985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714260/extras/03ecaa29e2d9d2f140fe45b23c467f49.mp4?t=1755158985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0Defend your kitchen from hooligans who are trying to rob you and damage your property. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0Beware of wild animals. Mr. Raccoon can be your best friend or your worst enemy, it all depends on you.</p>",
